      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "That is everything GregGuns offers. A continuous beam that ignores armor, and a rocket launcher that ends arguments. You built both from naquadah, lead and uranium, on the same Assembly Line that makes the rest of the pack\u0027s ZPM gear.\n\nFrom here, the rest of the mod is yours to play with. The ICBM line takes you from rockets to missiles and silos, the NPC chapters have things worth hunting, and the pack has plenty of ZPM to go. Take the coins, open the bags, and keep your hazmat on.\n\nIf you want a longer game, go back and fill in the quests you skipped. Every chapter has side builds that pay well and teach something the capstones do not.\n\n[note]This capstone pays out the biggest reward in the tab, with four bags and the best meal.[/note]",
